Subject: [PATCH] added book again button and revenue

Passengers asked for a quick way to book the same trip again, so past
tickets now have a "Book again" button. Operations wanted revenue on the
bookings page, so there's a revenue card above the table.

Works on my machine. I didn't add tests because it's a small change.

